Subject: [PATCH 12/16] dt-bindings: power: supply: samsung,s2mu005-fuel-gauge:
 add the S2MU004

The fuel gauge of the S2MU004 PMIC, found in the Galaxy A5 (2017), has
the same register layout as the S2MU005 one, and the same I2C address.
Add a compatible for it.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-sonnet-5-5
---
 .../bindings/power/supply/samsung,s2mu005-fuel-gauge.yaml        | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/samsung,s2mu005-fuel-gauge.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/samsung,s2mu005-fuel-gauge.yaml
index 05e420316..a746a1cef 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/samsung,s2mu005-fuel-gauge.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/samsung,s2mu005-fuel-gauge.yaml
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@ allOf:
 properties:
   compatible:
     enum:
+      - samsung,s2mu004-fuel-gauge
       - samsung,s2mu005-fuel-gauge
 
   reg:
